flowchart TD
    Start([PR Created / Synchronize]) --> Gate[1. PR Gatekeepers\n- Branch name check\n- PR template check]
    
    Gate -->|Pass| ParallelRuns{Parallel CI Execution}
    Gate -->|Fail| BlockGate[❌ CI Halted / PR Blocked\nNo further checks run]

    subgraph FastValidation [Fast Feedback]
        ParallelRuns --> Lint[2. Linters & Formatters\n- Prettier, ESLint, Style]
        ParallelRuns --> Build[3. Build Verification\n- TypeScript, Go, Rust, .NET]
    end

    subgraph TestCoverage [Test & Coverage Gate]
        ParallelRuns --> Test[4. Automated Tests & Coverage\n- Diff-scoped >= 80% coverage]
    end

    subgraph SecurityScan [GHAS Security - Dedicated]
        ParallelRuns --> Sec[5. Security & Quality\n- Secret Scanning\n- CodeQL SAST\n- Dependabot]
    end

    subgraph SemanticEvaluation [Semantic Evaluation]
        ParallelRuns --> DocEval[6. PR Documentation Evaluator\n- Evaluates API & logic changes]
    end

    %% Test failure loop
    Test -->|< 80% Coverage| CovFail[Exit 1: Output uncovered lines\nApply label: 'test-required']
    CovFail --> AgentTest[🤖 PR Test Generator\nTrigger: PR labeled 'test-required']
    AgentTest --> RunCopilotTest[Copilot analyzes diff & test logs\nGenerates unit tests >= 80% coverage\nOpens Stacked Remediation PR]
    RunCopilotTest --> AutoMergeTest[Auto-Merge Stacked PR into Branch\n.github/workflows/pr-stacked-merge.yml]
    AutoMergeTest --> Start

    %% Doc semantic evaluation loop
    DocEval -->|Docs Missing for APIs/Schemas| AgentDoc[🤖 PR Documentation Updater\nTrigger: PR opened / sync / labeled]
    AgentDoc --> RunCopilotDoc[Copilot analyzes diff & APIs\nDrafts Markdown guides & examples\nOpens Stacked Remediation PR]
    RunCopilotDoc --> AutoMergeDoc[Auto-Merge Stacked PR into Branch\n.github/workflows/pr-stacked-merge.yml]
    AutoMergeDoc --> Start

    %% Success path
    Lint -->|Pass| GateCheck{All Passed?}
    Build -->|Pass| GateCheck
    Sec -->|Pass| GateCheck
    Test -->|>= 80% Coverage| GateCheck
    DocEval -->|Docs Satisfied| GateCheck

    GateCheck -->|Yes| Dispatcher[8. PR Review Dispatcher\nPost summary & assign Copilot]
    Dispatcher --> AICodeReview[GitHub Copilot Code Review\nAI architectural & diff review]
    AICodeReview --> HumanReview[Developer Final Sign-Off & Review]
    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge PR into Main])
